#: documentation/content/en/articles/geom-class/_index.adoc:1
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "A guide to GEOM internals, and writing your own GEOM class"
msgstr "GEOM 内部机制指南，以及如何编写自己的 GEOM 类"

#. type: Title =
#: documentation/content/en/articles/geom-class/_index.adoc:1
